      <cyrillic>ханцуйлах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XANCUILA-</transcript>
      <definition>[=xancula-, xamcuila-] v.t. To put an arm through a sleeve; to put or carry something in the sleeve; to filch, pilfer.</definition>
      <page>927</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠠᠷ ᠢᠶᠠᠨ ᠬᠠᠨᠴᠣᠶᠢᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>γar ijen --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To put one's hands in the sleeves</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
